'''Cardboard''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 3]] or through trading. 

== Appearance ==
It’s blade is brown in color with a cardboard texture, hence the name. The guard is white, and the handle is black, both with tiny bold writing on them. 

== Trivia ==
*[https://www.roblox.com/users/18586528/profile Chris12902] is the creator of this knife.
*The original name of this knife was "Recycled Knife"
*This knife, along with many other knives are from other Murder games. ''For example: Murder by CloneTrooper1019''
*The description of this knife is: "You found this in the garbage. It looks pretty sharp..."<ref>[https://www.roblox.com/library/159435992/SKIN-Recycled-Knife Model created by Chris12902]</ref>

